From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caio <16298860+CainCosta@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:41:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] UI: Show Superbird's logomark in place of Ladybird's

The menu button, about:version and about:welcome draw Superbird's bird
with its red star, as on the app icon, in place of Ladybird's Lissajous
figure. The bird takes Superbird's ink in the neutral theme. The about
pages' favicon is Superbird's app icon.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

